MVzh2GP3o6nyWGmCMgwPZZ8CoiQQjvGIBDm9IZChom7IDv8fltDp-INisr3HAv7chQmqgH4OzDYubF2rcLWeanROoI0v7D\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh78euRTUOgswqES10o7s0f2zr4WlAw8uhUEQ1ZOcszQXgBsgtLa5CNApJMseoxbAyifYvlLLe2LXZ2INlkqGLthhH7DwRFaYCOuiMsFuD2oP6JpZaNnE7YjfriYheQdf-kzbFnMBQIrRUVXSVcAd_U3yxhrE38fqzEgV7NB4Ic6_dyvxKd5JylQb7MLc8u\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh78euRTUOgswqES10o7s0f2zr4WlAw8uhUEQ1ZOcszQXgBsgtLa5CNApJMseoxbAyifYvlLLe2LXZ2INlkqGLthhH7DwRFaYCOuiMsFuD2oP6JpZaNnE7YjfriYheQdf-kzbFnMBQIrRUVXSVcAd_U3yxhrE38fqzEgV7NB4Ic6_dyvxKd5JylQb7MLc8u\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjxhQvksujhkr5xh1bJWNvBV3L6G3KVgD2DIVGh3Il1qN5I-lSdkA6C09_QJEAm2hihdVSZZXEmBbL3VMVKGabkdIES6zq5V5LFKn7DELHbycZ04zGIsiGZoeFt829Hp_VM313B5KlASS9WdOnb-DKg_Ojn2S0d2Fk9k1iIXmDcc9TLTNpJ-L5P17KjiOhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjxhQvksujhkr5xh1bJWNvBV3L6G3KVgD2DIVGh3Il1qN5I-lSdkA6C09_QJEAm2hihdVSZZXEmBbL3VMVKGabkdIES6zq5V5LFKn7DELHbycZ04zGIsiGZoeFt829Hp_VM313B5KlASS9WdOnb-DKg_Ojn2S0d2Fk9k1iIXmDcc9TLTNpJ-L5P17KjiOhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjgruxbngkb7O6mubvST5Z7q0BvBi9UdoQ3QfNddvywV2ToB7b7GCBCFzBeBRKpenwLc_AhPsYIvxf17FbA079JqhnYEWjvwMW5HT5jDyOp-XgYgpobjG0YH7l8wrKwlRkChdq2yH6X0YkpAP_SL2u6pk9XrBdhsMqPKamGT4jW5l8HOtNqG-lsfkAVItNK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjgruxbngkb7O6mubvST5Z7q0BvBi9UdoQ3QfNddvywV2ToB7b7GCBCFzBeBRKpenwLc_AhPsYIvxf17FbA079JqhnYEWjvwMW5HT5jDyOp-XgYgpobjG0YH7l8wrKwlRkChdq2yH6X0YkpAP_SL2u6pk9XrBdhsMqPKamGT4jW5l8HOtNqG-lsfkAVItNK=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">細漢時對風颱天ê記持，就是：淹水、無電、食泡麵。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我ē記得有一改風颱，台北落大雨，淹水淹kah tsiok嚴重，有人無法度出門，消防隊用柑仔色ê船仔kā人載--出-去。我tī新聞看著人ē-tàng坐船，心內tsiok欣羨。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; 無電ê時，大人就ē kā蠟條提出來用。我iáu ē記得hit時tī暗摸摸ê浴間洗身軀，kan-na靠一枝蠟條照光，壁頂ê影一時大、一時細，tsiok恐怖！細漢ê我，緊kā水tshiâng-tshiâng--leh，就當做家己洗了--ah。暗時無電火，啥mih代誌to無法度做，規家伙仔圍tī蠟條邊--a開講。Tsit-má想--起-來，雖然生活tsiânn無方便，m̄-koh對囡仔來講，實在真趣味。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; 風颱天無菜thang買，上簡單--ê就是煮泡麵來食。細漢m̄ bat代誌，kā重鹹ê泡麵當做山珍海味，一直希望風颱mài走，hōo阮逐工食泡麵。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; Tsia--ê是我囡仔時ê記持，雖然風hù-hù叫ê聲tsiânn驚--人，m̄-koh一家伙仔做伙，koh-khah恐怖ê狀況mā ē過--去。</span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ=w448-h640\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"lin